{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:823c36dca1e8d4b7","name":"Pistoleer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-823c36dca1e8d4b7","title":"Pistoleer Talent Tree","revision":19729,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:30:23Z","sha256":"d4436da0ecdb4f3bf0c17f4e52df5111ddb88ccf567866d251256c82ef4ba4ba","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19729","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pistoleer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-823c36dca1e8d4b7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a master of wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," at the same time, and can use both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," simultaneously in unusual ways.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dash and Blast"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Running Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Running_Attack","referenceId":"reference:c4bf1e2e022526ec"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", when you are wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},", you may ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to twice your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," and make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"},". The normal penalties for attacking with two weapons apply to these attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Flanking Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flanked"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flanked"}," by two (or more) opponents and are wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". This is provided that you target only opponents that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flank"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flank"}," you and attack at least two targets.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Guaranteed Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," and make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with one of those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", even if you miss you deal damage equal to half your Heroic Level to the target. This consumes a single shot from the weapon not making the attack, and the weapon you attack with uses as many shots required by the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hailfire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," you can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack with one of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," as though the weapon were set to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},", even if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"}," would not normally be capable of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},". The normal penalties for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," still apply to this attack roll, and you may split the number of shots consumed between the two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Twin Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_I","referenceId":"reference:f50ca7ec9196bfe9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},", you gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rapid Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rapid_Shot","referenceId":"reference:d5cac053fa8ba463"}," feat.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
